      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like everything i spent my whole life building is just... rotting. the community, the art, even the way people talk here. it's all just falling apart and there’s nothing i can do to stop it. feels like i'm just sitting here waiting for a fire to finish the job. what's even the point of staying to watch the end?",
